WEBVTT

1
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,980
The distance was still too far just now

2
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,380
He still has time to turn

3
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,780
I have to let him get closer next time

4
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,870
Where is the specific location, Mr. Han?

5
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,870
Ocean current data is too complicated. Still calculating.

6
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,790
What I want is the precise location

7
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,990
Not an ethereal circle

8
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:46,700
Miss Shen does not have any positioning equipment on her body

9
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,900
We can only estimate based on ocean current models.

10
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,300
Wait, Mr. Han

11
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,700
Or the data has been updated?

12
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,900
Same time today

13
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,700
There happened to be a coast patrol helicopter

14
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,100
Pass through this body of water

15
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,780
Contact them immediately

16
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:10,130
patrol said

17
00:01:10,330 --> 00:01:11,330
an hour ago

18
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:13,420
They are indeed in this area

19
00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:15,820
Saw a new red signal bag

20
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:17,580
Where are the specific coordinates?
